        ecrm:P129_is_about  <http://data.silknow.org/object/03751304-86b3-3e3c-ba3a-5d03e9ba3ad3> ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/information/bibliography> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Percy Macquoid and Ralph Edwards, <u>The Dictionary of English Furniture</u>, 3 vols (London: Country Life, 1924), Vol. I, fig. 23 (p. 206) and p. 209\nSee H. Clifford Smith, <u>Catalogue of English Furniture & Woodwork [in the Victoria and Albert Museum]</u> (London: HMSO, 1930), cat. 545, plate 16\nRalph Edwards, <u>The Dictionary of English Furniture</u>, 2nd edn, 3 vols (London: Country Life, 1954), Vol. I, p. 236 and fig. 37 (p. 237)\nWestman, Annabel.  <u>Fringe, Frog and Tassel. The Art of the Trimmings Maker in Interior Decoration in Britain and Ireland</u> (London: Philip Wilson, 2019, ISBN 978 1 78130 075 6), p. 22, fig. 2:7"@en .

